WEBVTT

00:00:59.079 --> 00:01:01.662
Adrenaline causes 
your heart to beat faster

00:01:01.704 --> 00:01:06.204
and raises your blood pressure, 
overtime causing hypertension.

00:01:06.954 --> 00:01:11.413
Cortisol can also cause the endothelium, 
or inner lining of blood vessels,

00:01:11.454 --> 00:01:14.454
to not function normally.

00:01:15.746 --> 00:01:18.204
Scientists now know 
that this is an early step

00:01:18.246 --> 00:01:20.371
in triggering the process 
of atherosclerosis

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:23.746
or cholesterol plaque build-up 
in your arteries.

00:01:25.621 --> 00:01:30.538
Together, these changes increase
your chances of a heart attack or stroke.